   "y": 311,
   "width": 428,
   "height": 108,
   "text": "LLM \"confidence\" is self-reported. It can\nsay 0.95 and be right ~70%. Same 0.80\ngate, but the number doesn't map to\naccuracy → the gate is a guess.",
