   "y": 450,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 65.0,
   "text": "Calibration is what makes the confidence THRESHOLD (Noul\n/ gating) safe to automate on. Vendor claims JEV is\ncalibrated — benchmark it on your own goldens before\ntrusting a threshold.",
